  "prefLabel": "Rev 3001.05 Mortgage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3001.05 “Mortgage” means any instrument by which the real estate or interest in real estate is secured by a debt or other obligation and does not include modifications of the mortgage, or assignment of the mortgage.\n\nSource. #9437, eff 3-24-09; ss by #12137, eff 3-22-17",
